                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1982aa02-565d-349e-8221-2fc3527feee8",
                        "entry_id": "ff0789b8-9e56-3f0a-b431-dd9da7b3938c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Kakhetian wine"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32ba9dbb-ac8c-4162-a26f-56242a77fefe",
                                "sense_id": "1982aa02-565d-349e-8221-2fc3527feee8",
                                "text": "— Мы сла́вно пообе́даем, — говори́л он, — у меня́ есть два фаза́на; а кахети́нское здесь прекра́сное… разуме́ется, не то, что в Гру́зии, одна́ко лу́чшего со́рта… Мы поговори́м… вы мне расска́жете про своё житьё в Петербу́рге… А?",
                                "translation": "\"We'll have a fine dinner,\" he said. \"I have two pheasants and the Kakhetian here is excellent ... not the same as in Georgia, of course, but the best to be had here. And we could talk ... you will tell me about your stay in St. Petersburg, won't you?\"",
                                "english": "\"We'll have a fine dinner,\" he said. \"I have two pheasants and the Kakhetian here is excellent ... not the same as in Georgia, of course, but the best to be had here. And we could talk ... you will tell me about your stay in St. Petersburg, won't you?\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
